  "description": "A powerful and highly customizable textbox control for WinUI 3 applications. It provides an advanced text editing experience with features like syntax highlighting for multiple programming languages, intuitive search and replace functionality, zooming, line numbering, and smooth scrolling. With support for undo/redo, customizable themes, and efficient performance.",
